-- The slices of an init plan (IP2, TPC-H Q15): the coordinator runs its top
-- slice before the query, on PostgreSQL's executor; those below it run in
-- DataFusion, a split sum's state passing between them as batches.
SET datafusion.mode = explain;
EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT g, s FROM (SELECT g, sum(a) AS s FROM df_nc GROUP BY g) q
WHERE s = (SELECT max(s2) FROM (SELECT g, sum(a) AS s2 FROM df_nc WHERE id > 0 GROUP BY g) r);
                                                  QUERY PLAN                                                  
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   InitPlan 1 (returns $0)  (slice3)
     ->  Finalize Aggregate
           ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice4; segments: 3)
                 ->  Partial Aggregate
                       ->  Finalize HashAggregate
                             Group Key: df_nc_1.g
                             ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice5; segments: 3)
                                   Hash Key: df_nc_1.g
                                   ->  Streaming Partial HashAggregate
                                         Group Key: df_nc_1.g
                                         ->  Seq Scan on df_nc df_nc_1
                                               Filter: (id > 0)
   ->  Finalize GroupAggregate
         Group Key: df_nc.g
         Filter: (sum(df_nc.a) = $0)
         ->  Sort
               Sort Key: df_nc.g
               ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                     Hash Key: df_nc.g
                     ->  Streaming Partial HashAggregate
                           Group Key: df_nc.g
                           ->  Seq Scan on df_nc
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
 DataFusion: slice 0 not eligible: receives rows from a Gather Motion with nothing to compute on them
 DataFusion: slice 1 eligible
 DataFusion: slice 2 eligible, sends Arrow batches
 DataFusion: slice 3 not eligible: the top slice of an init plan, which the coordinator runs before the query
 DataFusion: slice 4 eligible
 DataFusion: slice 5 eligible, sends Arrow batches
